etry.", "hint": "", "reason": "Fold the shape along the line (or use a mirror); if the two halves match exactly, it is a line of symmetry."}, {"id": "m5u02s2p05", "type": "num", "prompt": "Lines of symmetry of the number 8 (as usually written)?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 2, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "m5u02s2p06", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which letter has a horizontal line of symmetry?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "B", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "A", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}, {"id": "m5u02s2p07", "type": "num", "prompt": "Lines of symmetry of a rhombus (not a square)?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 2, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}, {"id": "m5u02s2p08", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A shape with no lines of symmetry:", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "scalene triangle", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "equilateral triangle", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}], "adv": [{"id": "m5u02s2a01", "type": "explain", "prompt": "* Advanced. On a 3 × 3 grid, shade 3 squares so the pattern has exactly 1 line of symmetry. Describe your pattern.", "diff": "VH", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "rubric": [{"pt": "description", "kw": ["row|column|diagonal|middle|corner|top|left"]}], "need": 1, "model": "e.g. shade the top-left, top-middle and middle-left squares – it is symmetrical only about the diagonal from top-left to bottom-right.", "hint": "", "reason": "e.g. shade the top-left, top-middle and middle-left squares – it is symmetrical only about the diagonal from top-left to bottom-right."}, {"id": "m5u02s2a02", "type": "num", "prompt": "* Advanced. A regular polygon has 12 lines of symmetry. How many sides?", "diff": "H", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 12,